---
layout: layouts/base
permalink: "/{{ page.fileSlug }}/index.html"
css:
  primary: '#fff'
  secondary: '#ffde33'
  tertiary: '#deba01'
  neutral1: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)'
  neutral2: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25)'
  neutral3: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)'
  neutral4: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)'
  thumbnailHover: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)'
  colorBackground: '#322abb'
---
{% include 'components/intro.njk' %}

<section id="about" class="about t__section">
    <div class="about__more">
        <div class="t__container">
            <h2>About me</h2>
            <p class="t__lead">I'm a product designer passionate about building meaningful digital experiences. I combine my background in design and technology to create interfaces that are both functional and visually appealing.</p>
            <p>My work spans from UI design to frontend development, allowing me to prototype and implement the solutions I design. I enjoy working across the entire product lifecycle to deliver solid user experiences.</p>
            <p>I work closely with product teams to align business goals with user needs. I value research and collaborate actively with researchers and engineers to make informed design decisions.</p>
            <p>Accessibility is a core part of my process. I focus on creating inclusive designs that are intuitive and work well for everyone.</p>
            {% if skills %}
                <h3 class="t__typedivider">My skills</h3>
                <div class="about__skills">    
                    {% for skill in skills %}
                        <div class="about__skills__group">
                            <h4 class="h6">
                                {% include 'skills/' + skill.title | slug + '.svg' %}
                                <strong>{{ skill.title }}</strong>
                            </h4>
                            <ul>
                                {% for child in skill.body %}
                                    <li>{{ child }}</li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
    {% if reads %}
        <div class="about__reads">
            <div class="t__container">
                <h3 class="t__typedivider">Favorite readings</h3>
                <p>I read a mix of design, technology, and fiction books. Here are some of my favorite reads:</p>
            </div>
            <ol class="t__inline">
                {% for read in reads %}
                    <li class="t__inline__item t__inline__item--1">
                        <a class="t__hover t__hover--2" href="{{ read.link | url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank" title="{{ read.title }} by {{ read.author}}">
                            {% book 'src/static/books/' + read.title | slug + '.jpg', read.title %}
                        </a>
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ol>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if software %}
        <div class="about__software">
            <div class="t__container">
                <h3 class="t__typedivider">Software I use</h3>
                <p>Here are the tools and apps I use on a daily basis for design, development, and productivity:</p>
                <ol class="t__inline">
                    {% for app in software %}
                        <li class="t__inline__item t__inline__item--1">
                            <a class="t__hover t__hover--2" href="{{ app.link | url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank" title="{{ app.title }}">
                                {% include 'software/' + app.title | slug + '.svg' %}
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if hardware %}
        <div class="about__hardware">
            <div class="t__container">
                <h3 class="t__typedivider">Hardware I use</h3>
                <p>This is the hardware setup I use for my daily work:</p>

                <div class="about__hardware-accordions" style="margin-top: var(--size-l);">
                {% for category, items in hardware %}
                {% if items.length %}
                <details class="hardware-details" {% if loop.first %}open{% endif %}>
                    <summary class="h6" style="text-transform: capitalize;">{{ category }}</summary>
                    <ul class="link-style hardware-details__content">
                        {% for gadget in items %}
                        <li>
                            {% if gadget.link and gadget.link != "LINK NON CE" and gadget.link != "#" %}
                            <a href="{{ gadget.link | url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">{{ gadget.title }}</a>
                            {% else %}
                            <span>{{ gadget.title }}</span>
                            {% endif %}
                            
                            {% if gadget.category %}
                            <span class="about__hardware__category">&mdash; {{ gadget.category }}</span>
                            {% endif %}
                            
                            {% if gadget.components %}
                            <ul class="about__hardware__sublist">
                                {% for comp in gadget.components %}
                                <li>
                                    {% if comp.link %}
                                    <a href="{{ comp.link | url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">{{ comp.title }}</a>
                                    {% else %}
                                    <span>{{ comp.title }}</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                            {% endif %}
                        </li>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </details>
                {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="about__website">
        <div class="t__container">
            <h3 class="t__typedivider">About this website</h3>
            <ul class="link-style">
                <li>Uses a several typefaces:
                    <ul class="link-style">
                        <li><a href="https://processtypefoundry.com/fonts/colfax/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Colfax</a> and <a href="https://processtypefoundry.com/fonts/klavika-display/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Klavika Display</a> by Process Type Foundry.</li>
                        <li><a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Caveat#about" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Caveat</a> by Impallari Type.</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>This page scores ~90 of 100 on <a href="https://pagespeed.web.dev/report?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhoroman.com%2F" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">PageSpeed Insights</a>.</li>
                <li>The theme of this website dynamically adjusts in response to your operating system's colour scheme.</li>
                <li>Powered by <a href="https://11ty.dev" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">11ty</a> as static site generator, JavaScript, SASS and Nunjucks.</li>
                <li>Hosted using <a href="https://pages.github.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">GitHub Pages</a> and <a href="https://github.com/features/actions" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">GitHub Actions</a>.</li>
                <li>Current site version is {{ site.version }}.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{% include 'components/contact.njk' %}
